+         1. [0000|0000|0ccc|cccc] => [0ccc|cccc]                           -
+        single UFT-8 byte
+         2. [0000|0bbb|bbcc|cccc] => [110b|bbbb], [10cc|cccc]              - two
+        UTF-8 bytes
+         3. [aaaa|bbbb|bbcc|cccc] => [1110|aaaa], [10bb|bbbb], [10cc|cccc] -
